From: skyjet18 <57456827+skyjet18@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:24:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/49] fixed parsing webvtt with STYLE and REGION block

Ported to FFmpeg 9.0.2 from 0007-fixed-parsing-webvtt-with-STYLE-and-REGION-block.patch.
Skipping STYLE and REGION header blocks is already upstream in 9.0.2
(webvtt_read_header()); only the skip of chunks without a "-->" cue
timing line is ported.
---
 libavformat/webvttdec.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/webvttdec.c b/libavformat/webvttdec.c
index 4ca1e939..436bc1c5 100644
--- a/libavformat/webvttdec.c
+++ b/libavformat/webvttdec.c
@@ -119,6 +119,9 @@ static int webvtt_read_header(AVFormatContext *s)
                 p++;
         }
 
+        if (!strstr(p, "-->"))
+            continue;
+
         /* cue timestamps */
         if ((ts_start = read_ts(p)) == AV_NOPTS_VALUE)
             break;
